:: RobinTemple Donation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    An initiate carries the collection plate along the benches. Robin checks <<his>> pocket and looks at you. The temple also needs linen and food for the people it shelters.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    一名见习教徒捧着奉献盘走过长椅。罗宾摸了摸口袋，望向你。神殿还需要为收容的人准备布巾和食物。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if $RobinTemple.donation_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<if $money gte 100>>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Donate £1', '捐出 £1'] 'RobinTemple Donation Result'>><<set $RobinTemple.donation_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.donation_amount to 100>><<money -100>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $money gte 500>>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Donate £5', '捐出 £5'] 'RobinTemple Donation Result'>><<set $RobinTemple.donation_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.donation_amount to 500>><<money -500>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if $money gte 2500>>
    <<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Donate £25', '捐出 £25'] 'RobinTemple Donation Result'>><<set $RobinTemple.donation_day to Time.days>><<set $RobinTemple.donation_amount to 2500>><<money -2500>><</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
<</if>>
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Withdraw your hand', '收回手'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>

:: RobinTemple Donation Result
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<set _donationAmount to $RobinTemple.donation_amount>>
<<set $RobinTemple.donation_amount to 0>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You place your contribution on the plate. The initiate thanks you. Robin looks at the shelves by the door, already working out where the next delivery should go.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你把钱放进奉献盘。见习教徒向你道谢。罗宾望向门边的架子，已经在想下一批物资该放在哪里。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if _donationAmount gte 2500 and !$soup_kitchen_known>>
  <<set $soup_kitchen_known to 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The initiate mentions the soup kitchen on Wolf Street. Its kitchen opens in the evening, and extra hands are welcome.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      见习教徒提起狼街的施粥所。厨房在晚间开放，很欢迎有人帮忙。
  <</language>>
  <br><br><<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class='gold'>You learned where to help at the soup kitchen.</span>
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class='gold'>你得知了施粥所的位置。</span>
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<if _donationAmount gte 2500>>
  <<grace 3>><<ggrace>>
<<elseif _donationAmount gte 500>>
  <<grace 1>><<ggrace>>
<</if>>
<<if _donationAmount gt 0>><<npcincr Robin love 1>><<glove>><</if>><br><br>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink ['Return to the bench', '回到长椅'] 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
